[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1865.31, "timestamp": "00:31:05", "text": "德"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1867.87, "timestamp": "00:31:07", "text": "右边的人过来查看。啊，是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1871.75, "timestamp": "00:31:11", "text": "是的。谢谢光临。是的。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1873.83, "timestamp": "00:31:13", "text": "我当时就像在想所有的一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1876.87, "timestamp": "00:31:16", "text": "我周围遇到并交谈过的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1882.19, "timestamp": "00:31:22", "text": "还有一些其他的东西。不。然后我就想，等等……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1885.269, "timestamp": "00:31:25", "text": "我之前从未和你接触过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1889.19, "timestamp": "00:31:29", "text": "你是我邀请的 YouTuber 之一。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1891.83, "timestamp": "00:31:31", "text": "呃，是我在寻找的时候发现的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1894.549, "timestamp": "00:31:34", "text": "对于印度人来说，他们知道有哪些新的 YouTuber 回归吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1898.75, "timestamp": "00:31:38", "text": "白天和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1904.23, "timestamp": "00:31:44", "text": "对，我记得，我见过你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1907.669, "timestamp": "00:31:47", "text": "呃，在其他 YouTuber 的空间之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1910.07, "timestamp": "00:31:50", "text": "所以我就想，“是啊，我应该和他谈谈。”"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1912.289, "timestamp": "00:31:52", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "joq"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1912.95, "timestamp": "00:31:52", "text": "你和那些东西，还有那些东西。”我相信我们"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1914.783, "timestamp": "00:31:54", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "joq"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1915.669, "timestamp": "00:31:55", "text": "只谈过一次。你还记得吗？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1918.096, "timestamp": "00:3